# 统一行尾策略
# text=auto：让 Git 自动识别文本文件；eol=lf：仓库内统一存储为 LF
# 消除 Windows(core.autocrlf=true) 与跨平台协作者的 CRLF/LF 差异噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件：Git 不做任何行尾转换
*.jar binary
*.class binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary